<title>GREECE: TABLE-Greek/Bund gap widens to 415 bps, 335 vs BTP.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Greek/Bund gap widens to 415 bps, 335 vs BTP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread of Greece's 10-year bond over bunds widened to 415 basis points on Wednesday from 411 basis points on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Greek/BTP gap also grew wider to 335 basis points from Tuesday's 322 basis points.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.66%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.0%    04JUL07    5.51%	415	411 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.5%    25APR07    5.36%	430	426 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.31%	335	322 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.20%	346	339 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    6.13%	353	348 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.07%	259	252 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    6.23%	343	330 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices at 1050 GMT. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
